  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Combating food insecurity among the most vulnerable groups Syria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Oxfam proposes a series of activities aimed at addressing the current crises while delivering deeper, systemic and long -term change  - without causing new risks and vulnerabilities. At least 16,262 people from the target communities will benefit from the increase in local climate -resilient food production and reduction in malnutrition and undernutrition through agricultural inputs through Cash and Voucher Assistance (CVA) modalities, and light rehabilitation of facilities such as irrigation infrastructures and bakeries rehabilitation.</narrative>
  </description>
